# Rendered avatars, badges and furniture kept between restarts (IMAGER_CACHE_DIR).
# Regenerated on demand, and keyed on the hotel's asset build — never worth committing.
#
# Anchored: unanchored `cache/` matches at any depth and swallowed `src/cache/`, the source
# directory `DiskCache.ts` lives in.
/cache/

# `tools/pregenerate.mjs` output when no asset root is configured. Same reasoning: a rebuild of
# the hotel's assets invalidates the lot, and it is ~100 MB of PNGs.
/static/
